So let's go and solve it.

01:52.300 --> 01:54.500
We're going to select first the basic informations.

01:54.500 --> 01:55.940
Let's get the customer ID.

01:55.940 --> 01:56.660
What do we need.

01:56.740 --> 01:58.980
The first name the last name.

01:59.220 --> 02:00.540
And we need the scores.

02:00.780 --> 02:04.640
So that's it from sales customers.

02:04.800 --> 02:06.160
Let's go and excuse it.

02:06.200 --> 02:11.480
Now, the first task is that we have to generate a new field called full name, where we have to go

02:11.480 --> 02:15.000
and merge or concatenate their first and last names.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.280
So let's go and do that.

02:16.280 --> 02:18.760
We need the first name plus.

