Customer doesn't have any last name but she has a first name.

02:46.040 --> 02:47.480
So we have here a Mary.

02:47.520 --> 02:51.080
So the full name here is completely null which is not correct.

02:51.080 --> 02:55.960
For this example we have at least to show the first name Mary, even though that the last name is missing.

02:55.960 --> 02:57.800
So the result is not really accurate.

02:57.800 --> 03:03.000
And that's because we are using the plus operator between a null and Mary.

03:03.040 --> 03:08.420
So that means we have to go and handle the nulls before doing any plus operator.

03:08.500 --> 03:11.500
So again, here we can go with the coalesce or the Isnull.

03:11.500 --> 03:14.580
So let's go and create a new field using the coalesce.

03:15.260 --> 03:17.300
So it's going to be the last name.

03:18.220 --> 03:20.900
And now we have to define a new value if it's null.

03:21.060 --> 03:23.260
So we could have like something unknown.

03:23.260 --> 03:25.580
Or we could have like an empty string.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.460
And we can do that using two quotes.

03:27.460 --> 03:29.140
And between them there is nothing.

03:29.140 --> 03:31.180
So we are using an empty string.

03:31.860 --> 03:33.940
So let's go and check the results.

03:34.260 --> 03:36.060
Last name two.

03:36.660 --> 03:38.380
So let's go and execute it.

03:39.140 --> 03:44.220
Now we can see that the last name over here for Mary, it has an empty string.

03:44.220 --> 03:45.900
And it is not anymore a null.

03:45.940 --> 03:51.020
So now SQL knows okay, this is a string and there is no characters inside it.

03:51.020 --> 03:56.540
So with that SQL knows more informations and we can go and now concatenate those informations.

03:56.540 --> 03:57.700
So let's go and do that.

03:57.700 --> 04:03.660
So we're going to take the whole thing and replace the last name with the coalesce.

04:03.660 --> 04:07.600
So let me just remove this last name over here and execute it.

04:07.600 --> 04:09.480
So now as you can see, things looks better.

04:09.520 --> 04:12.960
Now we have in the full name for Mari only the first name.

04:12.960 --> 04:16.840
And of course, if you don't like it like this, you would like to have another default value.

