And with that, you can see immediately how there is here a missing last name, but it doesn't really

04:26.760 --> 04:27.160
look good.

04:27.200 --> 04:30.320
So I will just remove it and go with the empty string.

04:30.320 --> 04:31.560
We're going to go and execute it.

04:31.560 --> 04:36.480
So with that, we have solved the first part of the task where we have the full names and we are not

